<div class="mt-4">
    <h3>Template Blocks</h3>
    <p>This demo uses multiple templates so you can try the Inspector filter:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Variables:</strong> {{ title }}, {{ message }}</li>
        <li><strong>Loops:</strong> Iterating over items array</li>
        <li><strong>Includes:</strong> Each section is a separate <code>_*.html.twig</code> file</li>
        <li><strong>Filter:</strong> Type a template name (e.g. <code>header</code>, <code>footer</code>) to see only those blocks highlighted</li>
    </ul>
</div>
